<title>UK: C&amp;W clarifies directors' shareholdings.</title>
<headline>C&amp;W clarifies directors' shareholdings.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cable and Wireless Plc said on Friday that transactions on Thursday left director Stephen Pettit with a net additional holding of 9,015 shares.</p>
<p>Pettit sold 60,084 ordinary shares on June 12 at 536p per share to fund the exercise of 69,099 share options.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
